1 NOTE (Nelly) Gunnelius Knudsen Bjorgo was taken sick with appendicitis which with a complication of other ailments caused his death.  His funderal took place Thursday at the Big Canoe church, Rev. Sehus officiated.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a highly respected citizen, a good neighbor, a kind father and husband and will not only be missed by his dear wife and eight children but a large circle of neighbors and friends who were present at the funeral to pay their
2 CONC  last tribute of respect to the departed.
