1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sherman S. Lee
2 CONT PORT HURON - Sherman S. Lee, 81, died Monday, Apri 16, 1990, in his home.
2 CONT He was born June 22, 1908 in Port Huron and was a life long area resident. He married Lenore M. Crockett Nov. 15 1975, in Goulden Memorial Chapel, Grace Church
2 CONT Mr. Lee was a life member of Elk Lodge B.P.O.E. Lodge 343. He was active for many years with the Power Squadron. He was employed at Mueller Brass Co. for 22 years and was also active in real estate. 
2 CONT He is survived by his wife, Lenore; several cousins, nieces and nephews, and a brother-in-law and sister-in-law, Jack and Jeanne Crockett of Port Huron.
2 CONT Arrangements by the Karrer-Simpson-Crawford Funeral Home
2 CONT Burial wi be in Lakeside Cemetery
