2 CONC Buzzle postoffice in Beltrami Co.. Mr Lofthus has met with success in his financial ventures and is classed among the prosperous men of his locality. Mr Lofthus was one of the organizers of Sletten township, and was one of the fir
2 CONC st to be elected jsutice of the peace. He has served as township clerk for over ten years, and takes active and commendable part in all local affairs. He is a Republican politically, and is a member of the Lutheran Church. Mr Loft
2 CONC hus married in 1880 to Miss Margaret Henderson. Of this marriage ten children have been born, namely; Carl Helmer, Bernhardt A., Martin/Nellie (twins), Tina, Albert Nelson, Nellie, Mabel, George, Edwin.
