2 CONC ult of this and after checking all counties in Iowa, Carl Helmer's birth was never registered in Iowa.This search was done by the Bureau of Health statistics in Des Moines, Iowa. Helmer and his brother Martin were hunting up in th
2 CONC e forest to the north, when Helmer got separated from Martin and he ended up freezing to death at 26 years old.This cemetery was plotted out in 1906/1907 and Carl Helmer Lofthus is the first burial in this cemetery on the Loftus p
