1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maurine Griffith Obituary
2 CONT
2 CONT Griffith, Maurine 6/30/1932 - 6/10/2017 Catonsville, MD Maurine Joan Griffith age 84, of Catonsville, MD passed away Saturday, after a battle with cancer. Maurine was born and raised in Missouri Valley, IA but lived most of her li
2 CONC fe in Ann Arbor, MI. Maurine was a mother and also, from the 1970's to 1997, a clerk within the Ann Arbor City Clerk's office. Maurine is preceded in death by her parents, Joseph Earl and Myrtle Tamisiea, her daughter, Ruth Herkim
2 CONC er and sister, Vivian Eixenberger. She is survived by her husband of 60 years, Charles and sons Don (Denise), Bruce (Christy) and Dale (Edwige) and grandchildren, Austin, Leslie, Nick, Christopher, Monica, Victor, Emma, Sarah and 
2 CONC Thomas. In addition, she is survived by her sisters Bobby Purtle and Carol Haines. A memorial service will be held at Our Lady of Angels, Catonsville, MD on Saturday, June 17 at 11 am. Visitation will take place one half hour befo
2 CONC re services. In lieu of flowers the family is requesting donations to either the Ovarian Cancer Research Fund Alliance or the Cystic Fibrosis Foundation at http://fightcf.cff.org/goto/Thomas. Hubbard Funeral Home Inc 4107 Wilkens 
2 CONC Avenue Baltimore, MD 21229 410-242-3300 http://www.hubbardfuneralhome.com/
2 CONT Published by Ann Arbor News from Jun. 15 to Jun. 18, 2017.
