1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Carla M. (Nordly) Arny
2 CONT  Carla M. (Nordly) Arny
2 CONT Arny Carla M. Arny (nee Nordly), Wife, Mother, Grandmother, age 67, of Roseville, MN. Passed away peacefully on January 18, 2004. Preceded in death by her parents, Carl and Muriel Nordly. Survived by husband of 47 years, Dr. Rick 
2 CONC Arny; son, Carl and wife JoAnn; daughter, Karyn Grebner and husband Peter; grandchildren, Wil, Taylor, Britta and Cedric. Graduated with Bachelors degree from University of Minnesota in Education. Taught Physical Education at Mpls
2 CONC . Marshall U High School. Committed to community service and proudly received the Minnesota Medical Association Auxiliary Community Service Award in 2000. Special thanks to St. Joseph's Healtheast Hospice and her physicians for th
2 CONC eir care. A special thanks to family and friends for their love and support during our difficult journey. Memorial Service Saturday, January 24, 2004, 1 PM, St. Anthony Park United Church of Christ, 2129 Commonwealth Ave., St. Pau
2 CONC l, MN 55108, 651-646-7173. Memorials preferred to SAPUCC Summer Mission Trip, St. Joseph Healtheast Hospice or the American Cancer Society. "She will be greatly missed."
