2 CONT
2 CONT Sharon Hall Fadness BIRTH	27 Oct 1952 Bartow, Polk County, Florida, USA DEATH	24 Feb 2020 (aged 67) BURIAL	 Lakeland Memorial Gardens Lakeland, Polk County, Florida, USA  MEMORIAL ID	207449696 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 0 Sharon Hall Fadness, 67, passed away on Monday February 24, 2020. She was born on October 27, 1952 in Bartow, FL to the late Edwin “Jr” and Alice Hall.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sharon worked as a Respiratory Care Practitioner for many years. She was always helping others, and always there to lend an ear or a shoulder to cry on. Sharon’s faith was very important to her. She was very involved with her fami
2 CONC ly, and adored spending time with them.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sharon is survived by her sons Shaun O’Steen and James O’Steen, sister Shirley Davis, brother Edwin James Hall, 7 grandchildren, 10 great-grandchildren, and many nieces and nephews.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is preceded in death by her husband Alan Fadness.
